/T (As we move into June, we reflect with gratitude on the many blessings within our parish community. During May, we launched our fundraising campaign for essential church repairs, and thanks to the extraordinary generosity of our parishioners and supporters, we have already raised $103,500 towards our $150,000 goal. The response has been both humbling and inspiring, and we thank everyone who has contributed so far.)
